      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Acceptance doesn't mean you have to like the broken pieces; it means stopping the exhausting fight against reality. Instead of fighting the craving, you can acknowledge it as a powerful, temporary wave that will eventually pass. By letting go of the need to *fix* yourself perfectly, you can give yourself permission to simply *be* in this moment, even when it's painful.",
